  "full_response": "**Incident Response Report**\n\n---\n\n**Incident Title:** Credential Leak Involving API Keys for Payment Processing, Email Services, and Cloud Infrastructure\n\n**Date/Time of Incident:** October 12, 2023, 14:35 UTC\n\n**Incident Identifier:** CRD-2023-1012\n\n**Report Prepared By:** [Your Name/Title]  \n**Date of Report:** October 14, 2023\n\n---\n\n**Executive Summary:**\n\nOn October 12, 2023, our security team identified an exposure of sensitive API keys associated with payment processing, email services, and cloud infrastructure in a public GitHub repository. The leak was detected thanks to routine monitoring activities and has since been immediately contained to mitigate potential security threats.\n\n**Description of Incident:**\n\nDuring a standard security audit, it was discovered that API keys with access to sensitive systems were inadvertently committed to a public GitHub repository by an unauthorized user, [Redacted for Privacy]. The exposed keys had permissions that could have allowed unauthorized transactions, access to email accounts, and manipulation of AWS infrastructure.\n\n**Key Impacts:**\n\n- **Payment Processing:** Risks of unauthorized financial transactions.\n- **Email Services:** Potential for data extraction and operational disruptions.\n- **Cloud Infrastructure:** Unauthorized access to servers and storage.\n\n**Timeline of Events:**\n\n- **14:35 UTC (October 12, 2023):** Incident detected by automated monitoring tools.\n- **14:45 UTC (October 12, 2023):** Incident reported to the security response team.\n- **15:10 UTC (October 12, 2023):** Initial assessment confirmed the exposure of API keys.\n- **15:30 UTC (October 12, 2023):** GitHub repository identified and access by team secured.\n- **16:00 UTC (October 12, 2023):** API keys rotated and invalidate exposed credentials.\n- **16:30 UTC (October 12, 2023):** GitHub repository secured, ensuring keys are no longer public.\n- **17:00 UTC (October 12, 2023):** Contact with development team to investigate the breach.\n- **10:00 UTC (October 13, 2023):** User account implicated in the exposure place under investigation and restricted.\n\n**Actions Taken:**\n\n1. **Containment:**\n   - Immediate revocation of exposed API keys.\n   - Secure and remove the repository from public access.\n\n2. **Eradication:**\n   - Conduct",
